  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient and Sustainable Islands Initiative (RESI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESI is a global advisory network based at ODI, working with Small Island Developing States (SIDS) and their partners to frame policy problems, influence international institutions and find solutions to growing sustainability challenges in small islands. RESI aims to improve the conditions under which SIDS can achieve financial sustainability, environmental justice, international alliances and equitable societies.</narrative>
  </description>
